title: aa-intelligence-index-reverse
message: >-
  If you use this reconstruction, please cite it using the
  metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Jules
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-29"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AZERDSQ131/aa-intelligence-index-reverse"
abstract: >-
  Independent, community reconstruction of the scoring formula behind the
  Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index (methodology v4.3.2, v4.1.1 archived), with a
  dependency-free calculator, machine-readable weights and component-score
  data. v4.1.1: 8 models reproducing the published Index within max |Delta| 0.30
  on the band ~56-63. v4.3.2: weights + calculator live, first public dump pending.
  Not affiliated with Artificial Analysis.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - llm
  - evaluation
  - artificial-analysis
  - intelligence-index
  - reverse-engineering
